s NaN, comparison fails, so false.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'n1', 'value': 0.0}, {'parameter': 'n2', 'value': 'NaN'}], 'expected': False, 'description': 'Second argument is NaN – same reasoning as above, result false.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'n1', 'value': 'Infinity'}, {'parameter': 'n2', 'value': 'Infinity'}], 'expected': False, 'description': 'Both arguments are positive infinity – subtraction yields NaN, comparison false.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'n1', 'value': '-Infinity'}, {'parameter': 'n2', 'value': '-Infinity'}], 'expected': False, 'description': 'Both arguments are negative infinity – same behavior as positive infinity, result false.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'n1', 'value': 'Infinity'}, {'parameter': 'n2', 'value': 1.0}], 'expected': False, 'description': 'One argument infinite, the other finite – difference is infinite, so false.'}]}]
